{"availability":"available","full":"Aadithya2222/Tack","name":"Tack","description":"A minimal team board — lists, cards, drag, done. Next.js 16, Auth.js v5, Prisma, dnd-kit, Framer Motion.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-17T13:49:23Z","updated":"2026-09-17T14:00:04Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://tack-sigma.vercel.app/","topics":["authjs","dnd-kit","framer-motion","kanban","nextjs","postgresql","prisma","react","tailwindcss","team-board","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://tack-sigma.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:33.907Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:33.907Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:33.907Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T21:28:33.907Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A minimal team board. Lists, cards, drag, done.","Tack is a small, opinionated project board — boards → lists → cards, dragged between lists with the mouse or keyboard. It's built to look deliberate with almost no UI: one accent color, hairline borders, a mono-label layer for structure, and a single signature detail — the \"tack rail,\" a pine underline that fills a list header only when it holds cards."],"features":["Cinematic video hero — fullscreen looping background video with a hand-rolled fade-in/fade-out crossfade (no hard loop cut), Instrument Serif + Inter type, gradient overlays, and staggered fade-rise entrance animations.","Boards, lists, cards — inline creation, drag-and-drop across and within lists (dnd-kit), optimistic UI on every mutation.","Search & filter — a board-level search box dims out cards that don't match on title or assignee, without disturbing drag-and-drop.","Due dates — optional per-card due date, shown on the card and flagged red once it's overdue and still incomplete.","Completion tracking — a checkbox marks a card done and records when, server-side, like a to-do list; the timestamp shows on the card panel."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Aadithya2222/Tack/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e70ad31867395c1af2388250722f4e7af8dc009ac883e81b2cc55579f52a5d44","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:33.992Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:33.992Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A minimal team board. Lists, cards, drag, done.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Aadithya2222/Tack/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Login — Google + credentials Boards grid Board — lists, cards, drag & drop Board at 390px","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Aadithya2222/Tack/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e70ad31867395c1af2388250722f4e7af8dc009ac883e81b2cc55579f52a5d44","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Aadithya2222/Tack/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:33.992Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-17T14:00:04Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Aadithya2222/Tack/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:33.993Z","hash":"e70ad31867395c1af2388250722f4e7af8dc009ac883e81b2cc55579f52a5d44","originalBytes":4626,"storedBytes":4626,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["cards","lists","card","board","boards","dnd-kit","motion","accent","app","drag","due","google","layer","one","only","assignee","auth","auth.js","background","color","completion","credentials","css","date","design","detail","drop","framer","hover","instrument","inter","list","live","never","next.js","panels","pine","prisma","rest","search","serif","shadow","tack","tailwind","text","typescript","video","when","without","across","actions","active","almost","amp","animated","animations.","appear","audited","autosaves","between","blur.","board-level","board.","body","bone","borders","box","breaks","built","cards.","changes","checkbox","choice","cinematic","clean","client-side","color-bone","color-ink","color-muted","color-pine","color-rule","color-surface